From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: ManuelArto <manuelartociao@gmail.com>
Date: Thu, 12 Nov 2026 22:34:59 +0100
Subject: [PATCH 13/14] test(daisugi): reject a wrong EIP-8288 commitment on
 gossip, lookup and range-sync import

The mock EL built Daisugi payloads with a tree-root block hash, so no harness chain could import a Daisugi
block under the local block hash check, and nothing tested that check on the import path. Build them with the
real header hash, and import a block whose proof no longer matches its commitment, with a valid state root and
signature and an EL answering VALID: gossip, lookup and range sync without EL notification all reject it with
LocalBlockHashMismatch. With the check disabled the same block imports.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
---
